---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteNav from '../../components/SiteNav.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<Layout title="Upsell Calculator — Maxq Analytics">
  <SiteNav />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-6 bg-ink text-cream">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <a href="/#add-ons" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-white/40 hover:text-white/70 transition-colors mb-8">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"/></svg>
        All add-ons
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-medium text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-400/10 border border-emerald-400/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Grow</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-medium text-brand-300 bg-brand-600/10 border border-brand-600/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Add-on</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-black mb-6 leading-none" style="font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px); letter-spacing: -0.04em">Upsell Calculator</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-cream/55 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">Pick a client from the dropdown. The calculator instantly shows what they would pay under each of your pricing plans — based on their last twelve months of actual usage. No guesswork, no manual data prep.</p>
      <a href="https://calendly.com/philip-boontje" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-cream text-ink font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full hover:bg-white transition-colors text-sm">
        See it for your client base
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-14">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">How it works</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">Three steps from data to conversation.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-0">

        <div class="flex gap-8 pb-12 border-b border-ink/8">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">1</div>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">Select a client</h3>
            <p class="text-ink/60 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">Choose any client from the dropdown. The calculator immediately loads their full LTM usage profile from the Semantic Nexus — active user counts, transaction volumes, feature adoption, and any usage that maps to your pricing structure. No manual exports, no copy-paste.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-8 py-12 border-b border-ink/8">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">2</div>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">Compare plans against real usage</h3>
            <p class="text-ink/60 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">Each of your pricing plans is applied against the client's actual volumes. The calculator computes projected revenue per plan side by side — Standard, Plus, All-in, Custom — so you can see exactly what each option would have generated over the same period.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-8 pt-12">
          <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">3</div>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">Walk in with the number</h3>
            <p class="text-ink/60 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">The revenue difference — in euros and percentage — tells you exactly what a plan upgrade is worth for this specific client. Your CS or sales team walks into the conversation with a data-backed case, not a gut feeling.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Example output -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-warm">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-10">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Example output</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink mb-2" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">What the calculator produces.</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/50 text-sm">Click a company to see how the output changes per client.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Company selector -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
        <button data-company-btn="0" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium border transition-all duration-150 bg-ink text-cream border-ink">DXM Manufacturing Ltd.</button>
        <button data-company-btn="1" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium border transition-all duration-150 bg-cream text-ink/60 border-ink/15 hover:border-ink/40">Northfield Logistics B.V.</button>
        <button data-company-btn="2" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium border transition-all duration-150 bg-cream text-ink/60 border-ink/15 hover:border-ink/40">Barq Innovations S.A.</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Mockup -->
      <div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl border border-ink/10 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">

        <!-- Client selector bar -->
        <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-ink/8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/30 uppercase tracking-wider">Client</span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-warm border border-ink/10 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5">
              <span class="text-sm font-medium text-ink" data-calc="client-name">DXM Manufacturing Ltd.</span>
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-ink/30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/25 uppercase tracking-wider" data-calc="org-id">Org #2847</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
            <div class="text-right">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/30 uppercase tracking-wider">LTM period</p>
              <p class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Apr 2025 – Apr 2026</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-right">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/30 uppercase tracking-wider">Current plan</p>
              <p class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-ink" data-calc="current-plan">Standard</p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-right">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/30 uppercase tracking-wider">Actual revenue (LTM)</p>
              <p class="font-black text-ink text-lg" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em" data-calc="actual-revenue">€4,122</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Plan comparison -->
        <div class="p-6">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/30 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Revenue if moved to plan</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3">

            <!-- Standard -->
            <div data-plan-card="0" class="rounded-xl border border-ink/10 p-4 relative transition-all duration-200">
              <div data-plan-badge="0" class="hidden absolute -top-2.5 left-3">
                <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-white bg-brand-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Best uplift</span>
              </div>
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/40 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Standard</p>
              <p class="font-black text-2xl text-ink mb-1" style="letter-spacing: -0.03em" data-plan-rev="0">€4,514</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600" data-plan-delta-eur="0">+€391</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/30">·</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/50" data-plan-delta-pct="0">+9%</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Plus -->
            <div data-plan-card="1" class="rounded-xl border border-ink/10 p-4 relative transition-all duration-200">
              <div data-plan-badge="1" class="hidden absolute -top-2.5 left-3">
                <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-white bg-brand-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Best uplift</span>
              </div>
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/40 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Plus</p>
              <p class="font-black text-2xl text-ink mb-1" style="letter-spacing: -0.03em" data-plan-rev="1">€4,402</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600" data-plan-delta-eur="1">+€279</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/30">·</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/50" data-plan-delta-pct="1">+7%</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- All-in -->
            <div data-plan-card="2" class="rounded-xl border-2 border-brand-600 bg-brand-50 p-4 relative transition-all duration-200">
              <div data-plan-badge="2" class="absolute -top-2.5 left-3">
                <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-white bg-brand-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Best uplift</span>
              </div>
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 mt-1">All-in</p>
              <p class="font-black text-2xl text-ink mb-1" style="letter-spacing: -0.03em" data-plan-rev="2">€8,425</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-brand-600" data-plan-delta-eur="2">+€4,303</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/30">·</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-brand-600" data-plan-delta-pct="2">+104%</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Custom -->
            <div data-plan-card="3" class="rounded-xl border border-ink/10 p-4 relative transition-all duration-200">
              <div data-plan-badge="3" class="hidden absolute -top-2.5 left-3">
                <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-white bg-brand-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Best uplift</span>
              </div>
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/40 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Custom</p>
              <p class="font-black text-2xl text-ink mb-1" style="letter-spacing: -0.03em" data-plan-rev="3">€9,379</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600" data-plan-delta-eur="3">+€5,257</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/30">·</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/50" data-plan-delta-pct="3">+128%</span>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- LTM usage volumes -->
        <div class="px-6 pb-5">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/30 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Key usage volumes (LTM)</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
            <div class="bg-warm rounded-lg px-4 py-3">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/35 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" data-vol-label="0">Active users</p>
              <p class="font-black text-ink text-lg" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em" data-vol-value="0">1,037</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-warm rounded-lg px-4 py-3">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/35 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" data-vol-label="1">Transactions</p>
              <p class="font-black text-ink text-lg" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em" data-vol-value="1">1,235</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-warm rounded-lg px-4 py-3">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/35 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" data-vol-label="2">Events</p>
              <p class="font-black text-ink text-lg" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em" data-vol-value="2">2,118</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="px-6 py-3 border-t border-ink/8">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/25 uppercase tracking-wider">Data refreshed from Semantic Nexus · Volumes reflect last 12 months of actual platform activity</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What you get -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-14">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">What you get</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">Everything your team needs to act.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-warm rounded-xl p-7 border border-ink/8">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 17V7m0 10a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V7a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m0 10a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 7a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m0 0v10m0-10a2 2 0 012 2h2a2 2 0 012-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2a2 2 0 00-2 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Per-client LTM usage profile</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Active user counts, transaction volumes, feature adoption, and any usage that maps to your pricing structure — all pulled live from the Semantic Nexus per selected client. No manual data entry.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-warm rounded-xl p-7 border border-ink/8">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Plan-by-plan revenue projection</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Each of your pricing plans applied against the same client's actual usage — so you're comparing apples to apples, not guessing what a tier change would cost or generate.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-warm rounded-xl p-7 border border-ink/8">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Revenue delta in EUR and %</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">The difference between actual and projected revenue — per plan, in both absolute euros and percentage. The exact figure to anchor a pricing conversation on.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-warm rounded-xl p-7 border border-ink/8">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Repeatable — for any client, any time</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Switch clients in the dropdown and the whole calculator updates instantly. Your CS team can run this independently for every account review, every quarter, without involving data or finance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who it's for -->
  <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-warm">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="md:flex items-start gap-16">
        <div class="shrink-0 mb-8 md:mb-0">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Who it's for</div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em; max-width: 280px">The right fit.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-ink/60 leading-relaxed max-w-xl pt-1">
          <p>B2B platforms with recurring clients on differentiated pricing plans — where clients generate measurable usage volumes (transactions, members, communications, events) that can be mapped to plan-specific rates.</p>
          <p>Works best when you have at least 6 months of usage history per client and a pricing structure with multiple tiers. The bigger the gap between your cheapest and most capable plan, the more the calculator reveals.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Impact -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-ink text-cream">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-14">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Impact in the field</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-cream" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">What it's delivered for clients.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mb-10">
          <img src="/logos/clubcollect.png" alt="ClubCollect" class="h-7 object-contain brightness-0 invert opacity-60" />
          <div class="w-px h-5 bg-white/20 hidden md:block"></div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/40 uppercase tracking-wider">Using the Upsell Calculator since 2024</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-10">
          <div>
            <p class="font-black text-cream" style="font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 60px); letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1">313</p>
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-white/40 uppercase tracking-wider mt-3">Upsell deals closed</p>
            <p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Closed by the customer success team using data from the calculator.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-black text-emerald-400" style="font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 60px); letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1">€272k</p>
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-white/40 uppercase tracking-wider mt-3">Net ARR growth</p>
            <p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">New annual recurring revenue generated directly from upsell conversations.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-black text-brand-300" style="font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 60px); letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1">€1.4M+</p>
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-white/40 uppercase tracking-wider mt-3">Lifetime value</p>
            <p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Projected customer lifetime value across all upsell conversions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <p class="text-cream/50 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">ClubCollect's customer success team has used the Upsell Calculator since 2024 to identify upgrade opportunities with precision — replacing gut-feel conversations with data-backed cases tailored to each client's actual usage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Team -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-cream">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-14">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Built and maintained by</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">The people behind the calculator.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-8 border border-ink/8">
          <img src="/team/philip.png" alt="Philip Boontje" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full object-cover mb-6 ring-2 ring-ink/8" />
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-lg mb-1">Philip Boontje</h3>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Co-founder · Original developer</p>
          <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Philip co-developed the Upsell Calculator together with ClubCollect — building it directly around the operational reality of B2B SaaS customer success teams. He designed the core logic, the data model, and the first live implementation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-8 border border-ink/8">
          <img src="/team/daniel.png" alt="Daniel Laurentius" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full object-cover mb-6 ring-2 ring-ink/8" />
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-lg mb-1">Daniel Laurentius</h3>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Owner · Maintainer & developer</p>
          <p class="text-ink/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">Daniel now owns, maintains, and expands the Upsell Calculator. He handles client-specific adaptations, ongoing improvements, and is the primary point of contact for anything related to the add-on post-implementation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-warm">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="md:flex items-start gap-16">
        <div class="shrink-0 mb-8 md:mb-0">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Pricing</div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em; max-width: 260px">Bespoke, not off the shelf.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="max-w-xl pt-1">
          <p class="text-ink/60 leading-relaxed mb-5">The Upsell Calculator is a client-specific add-on — not a generic tool you plug in and go. Each implementation is built around your pricing structure, your usage metrics, and your client data model.</p>
          <p class="text-ink/60 leading-relaxed mb-8">That means the setup, configuration, and any ongoing expansion is scoped and delivered at our standard hourly rate. There's no fixed licence fee — you pay for the actual work involved in making it work for your specific context.</p>
          <div class="bg-cream border border-ink/10 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-5">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-ink/40 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Implementation</p>
              <p class="font-black text-ink text-xl" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em">Standard hourly rate</p>
              <p class="text-ink/50 text-sm mt-1">Scoped after an initial call — no surprises.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://calendly.com/philip-boontje" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-ink text-cream font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-ink/80 transition-colors text-sm">
              Get a scope
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
